    "message": "Accelerate pure-phase PNR selection and constrain click projections\n\nExtend the conditional-moment Gram tree to pure-phase detector selection with positive-norm fallback. Replay786432 small and4096 full dual-spectrum records exactly; retain all207 small failures. Generate frozen53-event quality samples and serial matched timings. Diagnose negative PNR endpoints on saved rounded states and distinguish canonical latent-base constraints from actual remaining-output physicality.\n\nValidation: 9517 independent final checks; 1031 tests run, 1002 successful, zero failures/errors; seven new native tests. Reused samples are not counted as new and old RNG guarantees stay withdrawn.",
